--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -6,6 +6,13 @@ Changelog
 Unreleased
 ++++++++++
 
+- ``@overload``: The first overload that matches the arguments according to
+  typing rules is chosen (e.g. ``type[...]``, unions, ``Self``), considering
+  the actual content of tuples, lists and dicts in the code, also with ``*``
+  and ``**``. If no overload matches, the results are still combined.
+- Support for ``Literal``
+- Better inference of ``and``/``or``
+
 0.20.1 (2026-10-12)
 +++++++++++++++++++
 
